5. AMBISONICS — libspatialaudio (LGPL, STATICALLY LINKED)
   The audio engine statically links libspatialaudio (LGPL-2.1-or-later). A static link carries
   an obligation a dynamic one does not, so: object files and build instructions sufficient to
   relink the audio engine against a modified libspatialaudio are available on request at
   ateliernumvr@gmail.com. libspatialaudio remains under its own licence.

